// Post 9 figure (margin trading): SbP09RecoveryMath
---
<figure class="sbp9-rec">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 340" role="img" aria-label="Loss and gain needed to recover: a 2x account losing 20 percent of equity needs 25 percent; 40 percent needs 66.7 percent; 57.1 percent needs 133.3 percent; the same 28.57 percent price fall with no loan loses 28.57 percent and needs 40 percent.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Loss on your money and the gain needed to get it back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mức lỗ trên tiền của bạn và mức lãi cần để gỡ lại</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="44" width="22" height="9" class="feqr"/><text x="278" y="52" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>loss of equity</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lỗ trên vốn</tspan></text><rect x="400" y="44" width="22" height="9" class="fgold"/><text x="428" y="52" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>gain needed on what is left</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lãi cần trên phần còn lại</tspan></text><text x="20" y="104" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Price −10% (2x account)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá −10% (tài khoản 2x)</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="76" width="44" height="16" class="feqr"/><text x="302" y="89" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>−20%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>−20%</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="98" width="55.00000000000001" height="16" class="fgold"/><text x="313" y="111" class="g"><tspan data-lang-en>+25%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+25%</tspan></text><text x="20" y="166" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Price −20% (2x account)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá −20% (tài khoản 2x)</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="138" width="88" height="16" class="feqr"/><text x="346" y="151" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>−40%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>−40%</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="160" width="146.74" height="16" class="fgold"/><text x="404.74" y="173" class="g"><tspan data-lang-en>+66.7%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+66,7%</tspan></text><text x="20" y="228" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Price −28.57% (2x account)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá −28,57% (tài khoản 2x)</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="200" width="125.62000000000002" height="16" class="feqr"/><text x="383.62" y="213" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>−57.1%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>−57,1%</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="222" width="293.26000000000005" height="16" class="fgold"/><text x="551.26" y="235" class="g"><tspan data-lang-en>+133.3%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+133,3%</tspan></text><text x="20" y="290" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Price −28.57% (no loan)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá −28,57% (không vay)</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="262" width="62.854000000000006" height="16" class="fgray"/><text x="320.854" y="275" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>−28.57%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>−28,57%</tspan></text><rect x="250" y="284" width="88" height="16" class="fgold"/><text x="346" y="297" class="g"><tspan data-lang-en>+40%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+40%</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Gain needed = L ÷ (1 − L) for a loss L. Equity at the force-sell line is 42.86M, so getting back to 100M is +133.3%.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mức lãi cần = L ÷ (1 − L) với mức lỗ L. Vốn tại đường bán giải chấp là 42,86 triệu, nên về lại 100 triệu là +133,3%.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

